        <mxCell id="nonat" value="No NAT Gateway&#xa;deliberate — a real finding (P5.5):&#xa;eksctl/Terraform both default to&#xa;creating one silently; explicitly&#xa;disabled here. Nodes don't need&#xa;NAT since subnets are public." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
